{"37:127:1":"But they denied him","37:127:2":"so indeed, they","37:127:3":"(will) surely be brought","37:128:1":"Except","37:128:2":"(the) slaves","37:128:3":"(of) Allah","37:128:4":"the chosen ones","37:129:1":"And We left","37:129:2":"for him","37:129:3":"among","37:129:4":"the later generations","37:130:1":"Peace be","37:130:2":"upon","37:130:3":"Elijah","37:131:1":"Indeed, We","37:131:2":"thus","37:131:3":"reward","37:131:4":"the good-doers","37:132:1":"Indeed, he (was)","37:132:2":"of","37:132:3":"Our slaves","37:132:4":"believing","37:133:1":"And indeed","37:133:2":"Lut","37:133:3":"(was) of","37:133:4":"the Messengers","37:134:1":"When","37:134:2":"We saved him","37:134:3":"and his family","37:134:4":"all","37:135:1":"Except","37:135:2":"an old woman","37:135:3":"(was) among","37:135:4":"those who remained behind","37:136:1":"Then","37:136:2":"We destroyed","37:136:3":"the others","37:137:1":"And indeed, you","37:137:2":"surely pass","37:137:3":"by them","37:137:4":"(in the) morning","37:138:1":"And at night","37:138:2":"Then will not","37:138:3":"you use reason","37:139:1":"And indeed","37:139:2":"Yunus","37:139:3":"(was) surely of","37:139:4":"the Messengers","37:140:1":"When","37:140:2":"he ran away","37:140:3":"to","37:140:4":"the ship","37:140:5":"laden","37:141:1":"Then he drew lots","37:141:2":"and was","37:141:3":"of","37:141:4":"the losers","37:142:1":"Then swallowed him","37:142:2":"the fish","37:142:3":"while he","37:142:4":"(was) blameworthy","37:143:1":"And if not","37:143:2":"that he","37:143:3":"was","37:143:4":"of","37:143:5":"those who glorify","37:144:1":"Certainly, he (would have) remained","37:144:2":"in","37:144:3":"its belly","37:144:4":"until","37:144:5":"the Day","37:144:6":"they are resurrected","37:145:1":"But We cast him","37:145:2":"onto the open shore","37:145:3":"while he","37:145:4":"(was) ill","37:146:1":"And We caused to grow","37:146:2":"over him","37:146:3":"a plant","37:146:4":"of","37:146:5":"gourd","37:147:1":"And We sent